<title>UK: Hamburgische Landesbank sets Pfandbrief.</title>
<headline>Hamburgische Landesbank sets Pfandbrief.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hamburgische Landesbank has set a self-led step-up callable Pfandbrief.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HAMBURGISCHE LANDESBANK</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   COUPON    *3.70 PCT  MATURITY  **30 JUN.00</p>
<p> TYPE   STEP-UP	 ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE   S02.JAN.97</p>
<p> S-SHORT LAST COUPON  LISTING    HAMBURG   DENOMS (K)  10</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO 02.JAN.98 AND 5.0 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p>		**CALL OPTION AT PAR ON 03.DEC.97</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
